                                "sense_id": "7ba54861-202f-3224-bb7a-3feb20f582b9",
                                "text": "\"Why?\" said Lucy in amazement, \"haven't you all been wondering where I was?\" \"So you've been hiding, have you?\" Peter said. \"Poor old Lu, hiding and nobody noticed!"
